00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.276
Lovely to see you, for
their staunch support.

00:00:41.276 --> 00:00:44.405
(audience applauds)

00:00:44.405 --> 00:00:47.340
Of interdisciplinary scholarship
and engagement at Yale.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:48.930
