00:12:56.910 --> 00:13:00.270
about putting tags on sharks
or putting tags on baby turtles

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:02.700
or any kind of biological study.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.380
And if we don't do those things,

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:05.980
how are we gonna learn anything?

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:12.060
So I would say the positives
far outweighed the negatives.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.250
- Right, t Then why wouldn't you do

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.390
something like this again?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.620
- Because I've done it.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:17.948
- Oh, in that sense.

