00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:07.370
And continues to, so in your
work with Sea Change and also,

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.540
you know, you work with
Craig and stuff like that,

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:12.840
how have you sort of come to
