00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:17.840
and free diving's place
in it as part of a world

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:22.440
where I think, you know,
we rely on tanks so much,

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.990
or snorkels or this or that or like,

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:27.000
you know, the shallow
versus the deep, you know,

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:30.840
how do we think about
diving culture, you know,

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:35.223
with large through free-diving,
which you know, yeah.

00:15:37.745 --> 00:15:40.950
