00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.150
anyone's seen "The Deepest Breath"?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.530
It's just an incredible way
to explore things underwater.

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:05.580
And you can go anywhere free diving,

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:08.400
you can hike to a bit of like

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.530
completely unexplored kelp forest

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.443
that's an hour away of
anywhere you can get your car.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.020
And all you need is a mask and a snorkel

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:18.420
