00:17:04.292 --> 00:17:05.831
Yeah.

00:17:05.831 --> 00:17:07.560
- {Priya] Yeah.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:10.113
So the next question is here she had,

00:17:24.214 --> 00:17:26.514
oh, I think it was so first.

